      "content": "Is OTTER able to run on CPU in single precision with 150 iterations and a step size (eta) of 1e-4, writing the result as an edge list? Inputs would be expression for 60 breast tumours (header row, gene IDs in the first column), a TF-by-gene seed edge list, and a TF-TF PPI edge list whose TFs are exactly the seed's TFs."
